# Office/Excel lock files (created while a workbook is open; never commit)
~$*
**/~$*

# Working copies of the generated tracker xlsx (e.g. "... v27 jorge.xlsx" / "... copy.xlsx").
# The canonical generated file has no space; working copies do. Never commit working copies.
docs/trackers/exports/* *

# Claude Code local state — ignore everything under .claude EXCEPT committed skills
# and the hard-deny floor in settings.json (owner 2026-08-04; deny outranks bypass).
# .claude/worktrees/ (agent worktrees) and settings.local.json must never be committed.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.json

# docs/module-completion/*.md is generated from the .json beside it by
# scripts/verify-module-completion.mjs (verify-step 1431). Committing a derived file made every
# manifest-touching branch conflict on it. The .json is the source of truth.
# Only the four per-module scoreboards are generated. SCHEMA.md is hand-written documentation and
# stays tracked — a blanket *.md would have silently untracked it.
docs/module-completion/accounting.md
docs/module-completion/banking.md
docs/module-completion/lists.md
docs/module-completion/safety.md

# Same thrash class for the in-app scoreboard TS (2026-07-29): committing
# apps/frontend/src/generated/module-completion.ts made every manifest-touching Cursor PR conflict
# on the derived file. Generate on typecheck/build/dev (frontend package.json) and via
# MODULE_COMPLETION_AUTOGEN / verify-module-completion --write-md. Do not re-commit it.
apps/frontend/src/generated/module-completion.ts

# Selftest scratch — these are now cleaned up by the scripts themselves (teardown runs before
# process.exit); ignored as belt-and-braces so a crashed run can never dirty another lane's tree.
.tmp-selftest-*.ts
.verify-wo-cancel-selftest-*/
.vscode/
CLAUDE.md
